        <mxCell id="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-100" value="&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;Uses own blood to Buff self and or&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;weapon and armor. Can cast spells and&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;skills with it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- Close to mid range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Self Buff&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Focus on attack spells&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Heals using Blood vials&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=50;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=1;autosize=1;spacing=4;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" vertex="1" parent="1">
