        <mxCell id="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-102" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;Uses blood from corpses or living to create&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;minions and cast spells.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- mid to long range&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- Army Summons&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- AOI spells&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- heals using others blood&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;- low to mid summon damage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=50;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=1;autosize=1;spacing=4;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-804" y="264" width="266" height="117" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-104" value="Uses Cursed Language to cast&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Cursed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;commands. you have limited curse chants and need to refill them by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;either sacrificing a precious items and valuables or&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;All who have less magic must&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;follow or get instant killed. Can use spells like slow,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;drain,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;push, charm, or higher tier cursed words like crush, implode.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- close to mid range&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- uses a lot of magic to cast&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=50;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=1;autosize=1;spacing=4;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-362" y="901" width="401" height="131" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-105" value="" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;startArrow=none;endArrow=none;segment=10;curved=1;sourcePerimeterSpacing=0;targetPerimeterSpacing=0;rounded=0;" edge="1" target="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-104" parent="1" source="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-73">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="-163" y="895" as="sourcePoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-106" value="Uses Curses to Debuff opponents and gain&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;advantage. Debuffs like weakness slowed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;can decrease their stats.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- close to long range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- also uses a lot of magic&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=50;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=1;autosize=1;spacing=4;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="121" y="800" width="272" height="88" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-107" value="" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;startArrow=none;endArrow=none;segment=10;curved=1;sourcePerimeterSpacing=0;targetPerimeterSpacing=0;rounded=0;" edge="1" target="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-106" parent="1" source="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-74">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="104.99999999999977" y="709" as="sourcePoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-108" value="Translated to Allmancer. Typical magic&lt;div&gt;user, can cast elemental magics like&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;earth, fire, ice, wind, water, lightning.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- close to long range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- uses decent magic&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- elemental damage&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- has elemental resistances&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=50;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=1;autosize=1;spacing=4;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="197" y="459" width="243" height="117" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-109" value="" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;startArrow=none;endArrow=none;segment=10;curved=1;sourcePerimeterSpacing=0;targetPerimeterSpacing=0;rounded=0;" edge="1" target="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-108" parent="1" source="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-70">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="427" y="711" as="sourcePoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-110" value="Dragon born class. Can use the power of dragons.&lt;div&gt;can cast dragonian spells like dragon fire breath,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;can transform into a dragon/human hybrid&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;and also a full transformation into a dragon.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- uses mana to stay in draconic form&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- close to mid range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- high speed, mid damage in hybrid form&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- low speed, high damage in dragon form&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- use dragon fire spells&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 60% resistant to fire in hybrid form&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- nullification to fire in dragon form&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- 30% resistant to fire in human form&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=50;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=1;autosize=1;spacing=4;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="533.5" y="868" width="307" height="189" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-111" value="" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;startArrow=none;endArrow=none;segment=10;curved=1;sourcePerimeterSpacing=0;targetPerimeterSpacing=0;rounded=0;" edge="1" target="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-110" parent="1" source="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-66">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="767.4999999999999" y="726" as="sourcePoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="221IrCQpB0Xr7pnIm8Ab-112" value="Enchanter enchants attributes and abilities and&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;buffs to self and weapons and armors.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The higher the level of the enchant the more&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;mana you have to use. Ability enchants cost the&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;most and you can unlock to enchant spells and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;abilities you&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;already know to your weapon or&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;from a list of abilities you can learn in the skill tree.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- close range&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- uses a lot of mana&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=50;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;strokeWidth=1;autosize=1;spacing=4;treeFolding=1;treeMoving=1;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;entityRelationEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;startArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;endArrow&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;segment&quot;:10,&quot;curved&quot;:1,&quot;sourcePerimeterSpacing&quot;:0,&quot;targetPerimeterSpacing&quot;:0};" vertex="1" parent="1">
